The N-Gage QD core's CPU: a TI ARM925T
======================================

Everything in this directory is this project's CPU. Every module and file is
named arm925t_*; arm925t.sv is the top and holds the core's configuration.
The CPU is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
(at your option) any later version. The full text is in LICENSE in this
directory.

Written for this project
------------------------

  arm925t.sv                the top: the configuration and the memory bus
  arm925t_core.sv           the eight-stage integer pipeline and its
                            integration with the parts below
  arm925t_fetch.sv          the pipeline's stages
  arm925t_front_decode.sv
  arm925t_decode.sv
  arm925t_execute.sv
  arm925t_forward.sv
  arm925t_rotate.sv
  arm925t_alu.sv
  arm925t_predict.sv        the branch predictor
  arm925t_store_queue.sv    the data cache's posted stores

arm925t_core.sv and arm925t_decode.sv say in their headers where they reuse
ZAP's work.

