What was changed
----------------

These files were copied from the commit above and then changed to make a
functional model of the TI ARM925T (ARMv4T) of Nokia's UPP_WD2 ASIC. The
changes are marked in the source with the tag "ARM925T:" and are described
in docs/CPU.md. In outline:

  * ZAP's own pipeline (fetch, decode, issue, shifter, ALU and memory stages,
    its branch predictor) is not part of this CPU. The pipeline listed under
    "Written for this project" replaced it on 2026-10-26; ZAP's is in this
    repository's git history.
  * The files and modules were renamed from zap_* to arm925t_* on 2026-11-18,
    the macros from ZAP_* to ARM925T_*, and constants and macros that only
    ZAP's pipeline used were removed from the three header files.
  * Every parameter's default is the value this core is built with, not
    ZAP's.

rtl/cpu/arm925t_gen.v is generated from the files in this directory by
tools/gen_cpu.sh (sv2v, and the fix Quartus 17 needs). It is a derived work
under the same licence.
